notes = "(!) syscard3.pce (md5): 38179df8f4ac870017db21ebcbf53114|(!) syscard2.pce (md5): 3a456f0eccff039eb5ff045f56ec1c3b (v2.0), 3cdd6614a918616bfc41c862e889dd79 (v2.1)|(!) syscard1.pce (md5): 2b7ccb3d86baa18f6402c176f3065082|(!) gexpress.pce (md5): 6d2cb14fc3e1f65ceb135633d1694122|(!) pac-n1.bin (md5): f69f173b251d8bf7649b10a9167a10bf|(!) pce-lp1.bin (md5): 761fea207d0eafd4cfd78da7c44cac88|(!) pac-n10.bin (md5): f0fb8a4605ac7eefbafd4f2d5a793cc8|CD-ROM content requires a BIOS; HuCard/HES content does not.|Select a System Card with Core Options > CD BIOS.|System Card 3 uses syscard3.pce and is the default.|Game Express discs require gexpress.pce.|LaserActive Japan BIOS: pac-n1.bin or pce-lp1.bin.|LaserActive US BIOS: pac-n10.bin.|Select the PAC region with Core Options > LaserActive Region.|Restart the core after changing firmware options.|MMI images require a 64-bit core."

description = "Libretro version of the very accurate Geargrafx emulator. This core supports PC Engine, TurboGrafx, PCE CD-ROM, Super CD-ROM2, Arcade CD-ROM2, SuperGrafx and NEC LaserActive LD-ROM2. It faithfully emulates all of the hardware and is an excellent choice for emulating these consoles on a modern system."
